{"format":"helia-content","version":1,"id":"day-quotient","title":{"Inline":[{"Text":"The Quotient and its Right Adjoint in Day Convolution"}]},"title_text":"The Quotient and its Right Adjoint in Day Convolution","kind":"definition","taxon":null,"url":"day-quotient.html","content":{"Block":[{"Group":{"role":"env","attrs":[["entry","day-quotient"],["kind","definition"],["label","Definition"],["numbered","true"]],"body":{"Block":[{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"Let "},{"Math":{"src":"C"}},{"Text":" be a small monoidal category. Recall that for presheaves "},{"Math":{"src":"A, B : C^\"op\"\n-> bold(\"Set\")"}},{"Text":", the "},{"EntryLink":{"id":"day-convolution","label":null,"body":[{"Text":"Day convolution"}]}},{"Text":" provides a closed monoidal structure:"}]},{"Math":{"src":"(A ⊗ B)(c) = integral^(u, v) C[c, u ⊗ v] times A(u) times B(v)"}},{"Math":{"src":"(A ⊸ B)(c) = integral_u A(u) -> B(u ⊗ c)"}},{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"which forms an adjunction "},{"Math":{"src":"A ⊗ - ⊣ A ⊸ -"}},{"Text":"."}]},{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"For covariant functors "},{"Math":{"src":"A : C -> bold(\"Set\")"}},{"Text":" and presheaves "},{"Math":{"src":"B : C^\"op\" -> bold(\"Set\")"}},{"Text":", we can define the "},{"Emph":[{"Text":"quotient"}]},{"Text":" and its right adjoint, each of which is a presheaf on "},{"Math":{"src":"C"}},{"Text":":"}]},{"Math":{"src":"(D_A B)(c) = integral^u A(u) times B(u ⊗ c)"}},{"Math":{"src":"(root(A, B))(c) = integral_(u, v) C[u ⊗ v, c] -> (A(u) -> B(v))"}},{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"These form the adjunction "},{"Math":{"src":"D_A ⊣ root(A, -)"}},{"Text":"."}]}]}}}]}}
